        { "host": "B", "text": "What does the attack actually look like?" },
        { "host": "A", "text": "Microsoft says the agents scanned internet-facing systems, exploited flaws including anonymous file upload and server-side request forgery, then used netcat and curl to pull down remote-access trojans for persistence and lateral movement." },
