      "type": "intro",
      "lines": [
        { "host": "A", "text": "It's Monday, November 9th, and this is The AI Edge, presented by Epilogue." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "Epilogue is an AI venture studio and consultancy in Toronto that builds for high-consequence work, the kind that's document-dense, driven by precedent, and reviewed by people whose licence is on the line. Epilogue builds products where the answer has to be right. Find out more at epiloguelabs.com." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "I'm Maya." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "And I'm Alex." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "Here's what moved at the frontier of AI since Friday morning. The advances, the research, and how the technology is being used for good and for harm, with every claim traced back to the source it came from." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "It's a long weekend's worth of news. What are the three that matter most?" },
        { "host": "A", "text": "Nvidia's board said on November 8th that it is opening an independent investigation after reports that its chief executive, Jensen Huang, had been the target of a foreign intelligence effort. Huang told staff the same day that he had been unfaithful to his wife." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "Microsoft says a Cambodia-based criminal group began using an agentic attack framework against financial firms in October 2026, and a security firm found more than a thousand public copies of a Claude Code settings file holding secrets, including database passwords and cloud keys." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "And Google DeepMind says AI agents cut the cost of forging an RSA-1024 signature down to 391 CPU core-years, from 1,380 in the original academic study." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "transition",
      "lines": [
        { "host": "B", "text": "Let's start with the labs, and with what happens when you give a model somewhere to keep what it learns." }
      ]
