      "lines": [
        { "host": "A", "text": "JAMA Network Open published a study of 14 adult primary care clinics in Boston, covering 209,009 encounters, 117,121 patients and 286 clinicians, looking at whether AI scribes helped doctors finish their notes the same day." },
