        { "host": "B", "text": "Does the board say anything about what was exposed?" },
        { "host": "A", "text": "It says it has no reason to believe that either national security or Nvidia secrets were compromised, but that the inquiry will examine all available information. It also says Huang fully supports the review, and that the board has confidence in him and his leadership team." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "And Huang emailed staff the same day, telling them he had been unfaithful to his wife, that there is no excuse for what he did, and that he is deeply sorry. An Nvidia spokesperson told CNBC he is committed to continuing as chief executive without interruption." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "CNBC says US intelligence agencies have expressed concerns that the woman, who is affiliated with an Nvidia customer, has been passing information to Beijing, citing reports in two newspapers." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "And the spying allegation has not been publicly substantiated. Neither the board's statement nor Huang's email makes any allegation about a relationship with her. We could not open the original newspaper reports, so those claims are only as CNBC and TechCrunch relay them. Nvidia reports quarterly earnings on November 17th." }
      ]
